This project contains device support code for OpenWrt.

The OpenWrt project is licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0.
The device tree source and build integration files in this repository are
provided under the same terms (GPL-2.0-only) unless stated otherwise.

The generic MT7981 EEPROM blob in
package/firmware/mt7981-eeprom-default/files/mt7981_eeprom_mt7976_dbdc.bin
originates from the OpenWrt mt76 firmware package and is distributed under
the BSD-3-Clause-Clear license (see the mt76 project).
